        captions:
        - text: TEMPORAL CUSTOMS BUREAU
          kind: 0
          rect:
            x0: 0.2897
            y0: 0.0269
            x1: 0.6999
            y1: 0.0479
          share: 1
          ink: '#686B80'
          centre: 1
        - text: OFFICE OF INTERVAL COMPLIANCE
          kind: 0
          rect:
            x0: 0.3197
            y0: 0.0479
            x1: 0.6797
            y1: 0.0576
          share: 1
          ink: '#A18D91'
          centre: 1
        - text: STRANDING WAIVER
          kind: 1
          rect:
            x0: 0.14
            y0: 0.3096
            x1: 0.8594
            y1: 0.4116
          share: 1
          ink: '#560404'
          centre: 1
        - text: WAIVER No.
          kind: 0
          rect:
            x0: 0.3594
            y0: 0.4458
            x1: 0.5195
            y1: 0.4688
          share: 0.857
          ink: '#3E3D4F'
          centre: 0
        - text: By acknowledgment of this instrument, the traveller accepts all temporal
            irregularities, local customs, and interval displacement arising from
            voluntary passage beyond the authorized present. No return interval is
            guaranteed.
          kind: 2
          rect:
            x0: 0.1615
            y0: 0.4946
            x1: 0.8594
            y1: 0.5366
          share: 0.22
          ink: '#2E3346'
          centre: 0
        - text: The traveller assumes responsibility for identity drift, calendar
            variance, memory desynchronization, and all ordinary consequences of
            remaining within a prior era. Claims against the Bureau shall not suspend
            the applicable century.
          kind: 2
          rect:
            x0: 0.1615
            y0: 0.5479
            x1: 0.8594
            y1: 0.5898
          share: 0.226
          ink: '#2E3346'
          centre: 0
        - text: Acceptance confirms that the traveller has received notice of the
            conditions of stranding and agrees to proceed without expectation of
            rescue, correction, or restoration. This waiver remains in force across
            all recognized continuities.
          kind: 2
          rect:
            x0: 0.1615
            y0: 0.5977
            x1: 0.8594
            y1: 0.6406
          share: 0.212
          ink: '#2E3346'
          centre: 0
        clean: 1
